{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f560c474555cc22353f7bb93dfa2f9103b88816017ae271ebc73851cc8c479f1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄們，我心裏所願的，向上帝所求的，是要以色列人得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我可以證明，他們向上帝有熱心，但不是按着真知識；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["因為不知道上帝的義，想要立自己的義，就不服上帝的義了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["律法的總結就是基督，使凡信他的都得着義。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["求告主名的必要得救"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西寫着說：「人若行那出於律法的義，就必因此活着。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["惟有出於信心的義如此說：「你不要心裏說：誰要升到天上去呢？（就是要領下基督來；）"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["誰要下到陰間去呢？（就是要領基督從死裏上來。）」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他到底怎麼說呢？他說：",{"text":"這道離你不遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正在你口裏，在你心裏－","poem":1},"（就是我們所傳信主的道。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你若口裏認耶穌為主，心裏信上帝叫他從死裏復活，就必得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因為，人心裏相信就可以稱義，口裏承認就可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["經上說：「凡信他的人必不至於羞愧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["猶太人和希臘人並沒有分別，因為眾人同有一位主；他也厚待一切求告他的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為「凡求告主名的就必得救」。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，人未曾信他，怎能求他呢？未曾聽見他，怎能信他呢？沒有傳道的，怎能聽見呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["若沒有奉差遣，怎能傳道呢？如經上所記：「報福音、傳喜信的人，他們的腳蹤何等佳美！ 」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["只是人沒有都聽從福音，因為以賽亞說：「主啊，我們所傳的有誰信呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["可見，信道是從聽道來的，聽道是從基督的話來的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但我說，人沒有聽見嗎？誠然聽見了。",{"text":"他們的聲音傳遍天下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的言語傳到地極。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我再說，以色列人不知道嗎？先有摩西說：",{"text":"我要用那不成子民的惹動你們的憤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用那無知的民觸動你們的怒氣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["又有以賽亞放膽說：",{"text":"沒有尋找我的，我叫他們遇見；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有訪問我的，我向他們顯現。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["至於以色列人，他說：「我整天伸手招呼那悖逆頂嘴的百姓。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}